# Lines from a class back to itself: a reflexive association and a tree that holds itself
diagram class
id org-tree
title An employee reports to another employee, and a folder holds folders
desc Class diagram. Employee is associated with itself: each employee has at most one manager and any number of reports. Folder is composed of folders. A team is staffed by employees, and an employee owns folders.

class Team
class Employee {
  +name: String
  +hire(): void
}
class Folder {
  +name: String
}

Team "1" o-- "1..*" Employee : staffed by
Employee "0..1 manager" -- "* reports" Employee : manages
Folder "0..1 parent" *-- "* children" Folder : holds
Employee "1 owner" -- "*" Folder : owns
